ackground music.\n\nNo combat yet.\n\nKeep the mysterious figure difficult to see\nduring the pursuit.\n\nUse only THREE major cinematic shots.\n\n\n=== VIDEO SUMMARY ===\n\nRiven is looking deeper into the burning settlement\nafter the mysterious figure has disappeared.\n\nSuddenly,\nshe hears the same strange sound\nfrom somewhere far deeper inside the village.\n\nRiven immediately recognizes it.\n\nThrough the distant smoke,\nshe briefly sees a dark figure move\nacross an opening between burning buildings.\n\nRiven reacts instantly.\n\nShe breaks into a full-speed sprint\nand pursues it deeper into the settlement.\n\nDuring the chase,\nRiven occasionally catches brief glimpses\nof the dark figure moving farther ahead through the smoke.\n\nIt never remains visible long enough\nfor her to reach it.\n\nThe pursuit leads Riven deeper\ninto a more isolated part of the burning settlement.\n\nEventually,\nRiven reaches a wider open area.\n\nThe dark figure is nowhere to be seen.\n\nRiven slows and searches the smoke.\n\nThen the mysterious figure finally emerges\nand stands still ahead of her.\n\nRiven stops.\n\nThey face each other.\n\nCUT before combat begins.\n\n\n=== SHOT 1 — SHE HEARS IT ===\n\nOPEN on Riven looking down\nthe burning village road.\n\nShe is alone.\n\nThe mysterious figure is no longer visible.\n\nDo not recreate a long static establishing shot.\n\nKeep the opening brief.\n\nFire burns throughout the settlement.\n\nDark smoke moves between the buildings.\n\nAsh drifts through the orange light.\n\nRiven quietly scans the road ahead.\n\n\nThen—\n\nfrom somewhere FAR DEEPER inside the settlement,\n\na faint unnatural sound is heard.\n\n\nRiven immediately reacts.\n\nHer head turns sharply toward the sound.\n\nShe recognizes it.\n\n\nCamera follows her gaze\nfar down the burning road.\n\nAt first there is only:\n\nfire,\n\nsmoke,\n\nburning structures,\n\nand empty space.\n\n\nThen—\n\nfar ahead,\n\nthrough a temporary opening in the smoke,\n\na DARK HUMAN-LIKE FIGURE\nmoves quickly across the road\nbetween two burning structures.\n\n\nIt is only visible for a brief moment.\n\nDo not clearly reveal its face or body.\n\nDo not make it stop and pose.\n\nIt crosses the distant opening\nand immediately disappears behind smoke and structures.\n\n\nRiven sees it.\n\n\nThere is almost no hesitation.\n\n\nShe immediately launches forward\ninto a FULL-SPEED SPRINT.\n\n\nHer first steps are explosive and urgent.\n\nThe camera accelerates with her.\n\nRiven races directly toward\nthe place where she saw the figure.\n\n\n=== SHOT 2 — THE PURSUIT ===\n\nStay close to Riven\nas she runs at full speed\ndeeper into the burning settlement.\n\nUse a dynamic tracking camera.\n\nAlternate naturally between:\n\nclose rear tracking,\n\nthree-quarter side tracking,\n\nand brief low tracking near her running legs,\n\nwithout turning the sequence\ninto many separate disconnected shots.\n\n\nRiven runs hard.\n\nHer body leans naturally forward.\n\nHer arms drive with her stride.\n\nHer hair and clothing react naturally\nto the speed of her movement.\n\nHer breathing becomes stronger.\n\nKeep her weapon secure\nand visually consistent with the provided reference.\n\n\nThe environment rushes past her.\n\nBurning wooden buildings line the road.\n\nSmoke moves across her path.\n\nShe passes scattered debris.\n\nFirelight flickers rapidly across her\nas she moves between structures.\n\n\nRiven is not running randomly.\n\nShe is FOLLOWING the mysterious figure.\n\n\nFar ahead—\n\nanother brief DARK MOVEMENT\nappears through the smoke.\n\n\nThe figure crosses another opening.\n\nRiven catches sight of it.\n\nShe immediately adjusts her direction\nand continues the pursuit.\n\n\nKeep the mysterious figure\nALWAYS FARTHER AHEAD OF RIVEN.\n\nIt never runs beside her.\n\nIt never runs behind her.\n\nRiven never catches it during the chase.\n\n\nDo not show the figure running like a normal human.\n\nIts movement should feel strange and unnaturally fast.\n\nA dark silhouette briefly glides\nor rushes through the smoke,\n\nthen disappears again behind the environment.\n\n\nRiven keeps chasing it.\n\n\nThe roads become narrower.\n\nThe crowd and civilians are completely gone.\n\nThe deeper Riven goes,\nthe more isolated the environment becomes.\n\n\nShe runs through another thick bank of smoke.\n\nFor a moment,\nthe smoke fills most of the frame.\n\n\nRiven pushes through it.\n\n\n=== SHOT 3 — IT STOPS RUNNING ===\n\nRiven emerges from the smoke\ninto a wider open area\ndeep inside the burning settlement.\n\nA small crossroads,\nopen village yard,\nor wider section between damaged buildings.\n\nThere is more space here.\n\nBurning structures surround the area.\n\nSmoke drifts slowly across the ground\nand between the buildings.\n\n\nRiven continues running forward\nfor several steps.\n\nBut—\n\nthe mysterious figure is nowhere to be seen.\n\n\nRiven quickly slows.\n\nHer sprint becomes a controlled stop.\n\n\nShe looks ahead.\n\nNothing.\n\n\nShe looks toward one side.\n\nOnly smoke and fire.\n\n\nThen toward the other.\n\nStill nothing.\n\n\nKeep the tension quiet.\n\nOnly Riven's breathing,\nthe fire,\nand the sound of burning wood remain.\n\n\nRiven becomes completely still.\n\nShe watches the smoke.\n\n\nThen—\n\nahead of her,\n\na large section of dark smoke\nslowly shifts.\n\n\nThe MYSTERIOUS DARK FIGURE\ngradually becomes visible.\n\n\nThis time—\n\nIT IS NOT RUNNING.\n\n\nIt stands motionless\non the opposite side of the open area.\n\n\nKeep a clear distance between them.\n\n\nThe figure remains almost humanoid,\nbut subtly unnatural.\n\nIts silhouette is dark.\n\nIts shoulders appear slightly too high.\n\nIts arms appear slightly too long.\n\nIts edges blend unnaturally\ninto the surrounding smoke.\n\nOrange firelight does not illuminate it normally.\n\nIts face remains unclear.\n\nNo glowing eyes.\n\nNo clear facial details.\n\n\nRiven immediately locks her attention onto it.\n\n\nThe figure does not disappear.\n\nIt does not move away.\n\nIt simply stands there.\n\n\nRiven understands:\n\nthe chase is over.\n\n\nSlowly,\nRiven shifts her posture.\n\nHer breathing begins to settle.\n\nHer hand moves toward her weapon.\n\n\nKeep the weapon exactly consistent\nwith the provided reference.\n\n\nThe mysterious figure remains still.\n\n\nHold a wider composition:\n\nRiven on one side\nof the burning open area.\n\nThe mysterious figure\non the opposite side.\n\nFire and smoke between them.\n\n\nNeither attacks yet.\n\n\nHold the confrontation briefly.\n\n\nCUT.\n\n\n=== END STATE ===\n\nRiven heard the mysterious figure\ndeeper inside the burning settlement.\n\nShe saw it briefly\nand immediately pursued it at full speed.\n\nThe figure led her deeper\nthrough the burning village.\n\nRiven has now reached\na wider isolated area.\n\nThe mysterious figure has stopped fleeing.\n\nIt stands directly ahead of her.\n\nRiven prepares herself.\n\nNo combat has begun yet.\n\nCUT.", "reply_message_format": "生成された動画：%s"}}}, "chat_history_count": "0", "chat_id": "1514271955056913", "chat_next": "1", "clear_context": "1", "client_report_scene": "gui", "commerce_feature_key": "doubao_create_pe", "cot_switch": "0", "disable_regen": "1", "expose_scene": "review-StreamPacket", "finish_reason_chat": "safety_terminated:completion", "finish_time_ms": "1790657957892", "image_attachment_num": "3", "inner_app_id": "495671", "inner_bot_id": "7339470689562525703", "inner_cluster": "default", "inner_did": "7690631663022474757", "inner_env": "prod", "inner_flow_app_variant": "doubao", "inner_is_dola_agent_hub": "1", "inner_is_tour": "false", "inner_libra_versions": "72202937,73582984,76233209,76915148,76999789,77046910,77046923,77068989,77069090,77088724,77102831,71795104,72061060,72168304,76461562,76709907,77202863,76672284,76961157,77019338,77088588,77231336", "inner_log_id": "202609291259167830B3FE870B877C4196", "inner_msg_lang_code": "en", "inner_msg_lang_confidence": "0.9986429810523987", "inne